 ## How it works
-The method operates by modifying the standard training loop of a voxel-based NeRF (such as TensoRF-VM) to include a differentiable rate term. It relies on predictive coding, where each voxel's value is predicted from a reference neighbor (typically the preceding voxel in a traversal order) to minimize the residual entropy [S1].
